: "2075960406326122", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623345_2075960409659455_8951785952949536494_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4d5HiGEYaVwQ7kNvwEwjFZL&_nc_oc=AdqpNvxytzXONeZvPRag95_ITbXRjh1LU-lwuhppydG3zKcz9S0qZyvXl8Po-T-Cq-4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQSR8aka_ESkiMMpwUDYBuZa-1w3WqyCvO5yRRhUsCe6w&oe=6AFB3B98"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Los Monos Revamped", "keywords": ["fangame", "losmonos", "monkey", "gorilla"], "long_description": "# \ud83d\udc35 Welcome to **Los Monos Revamped!**\n\nExplore, climb, compete, and have fun with friends in an exciting multiplayer VR adventure!\n\n## \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Explore Amazing Maps\n\n\ud83c\udf32 Forest\n\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f Canyons\n\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f Beach\n\n## \ud83c\udfae Game Modes\n\n\ud83d\udc7b Horror\n\ud83c\udfc3 Parkour\n\u2694\ufe0f PvP\n\ud83e\uddd7 Only Up\n\ud83e\ude9f Glass Bridge\n\n## \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Customize Your Monkey\n\nUnlock and collect a variety of awesome cosmetics from the in-game shop to create your own unique style.\n\n## \ud83c\udf1f Join the Adventure!\n\nWhether you're challenging yourself, battling other players, or exploring with friends, **Los Monos Revamped** offers fun experiences for players of all skill levels.\n\nJump in, make new friends, and become part of the monkey adventure! \ud83d\udc35\ud83c\udf89\n", "short_description": "\ud83d\udc35 Welcome to Los Monos Revamped!\n\nExplore Forest \ud83c\udf32, Canyons \ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f, and Beach \ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f while playing exciting game modes like Horror \ud83d\udc7b, Parkour \ud83c\udfc3, PvP \u2694\ufe0f, Only Up \ud83e\uddd7, and Glass Bridge \ud83e\ude9f .\n\n\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Unlock awesome cosmetics, play with friends, and experience endless VR fun!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/los-monos-reborn/privacy-policy?authuser=0", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Yosoylaboma", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/los-monos-reborn/home?authuser=0", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1133525123187044"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2489319464870914"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2489319464870914"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1784736540, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2489319464870914"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1312494808623407", "version": "1"}, "id": "1564498948524297", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1112441411962082", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1312494808623407"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1564498948524297"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1792947693, "id": "1312494808623407", "version": "1", "version_co